<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Daewoo lifts half yr shr, no div.</title>
<headline>Daewoo lifts half yr shr, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30 1996 (million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     5.2	   vs  0.2</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 nil	   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Total net earnings    2.67	  vs  0.06</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   4.11	  vs  0.08</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.44	  vs  0.03</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   4.66	  vs  0.56</p>
<p>    Turnover		173.53	  vs 44.99</p>
<p>Full name: Daewoo Electronics SA Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Despite high rates of interest, the company expects sales growth in all its brands during the next six months, in particular from satellite equipment. The board therefore anticipates further improvement in earnings for the year to December 31 1996.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
